// 03 - Which activity failed, and why
// Source : workspace monitoring, table FabricDataPipelinesActivityRunsLogs
// Status : RAN LIVE 2026-11-03. Found the failing step and FailureType = UserError.
// Caveat : in the demo data, ItemName on this table held the pipeline's ID, not
//          its name. To get names, join to ItemJobEventLogs on the item id.
FabricDataPipelinesActivityRunsLogs
| where Status == "Failed"
| project OperationStartTime, ItemName, ActivityName, ActivityType, FailureType, DurationMs
| order by OperationStartTime desc
